      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm sorry to hear you're experiencing this. While the situation isn't ideal, there are a few measures you might consider to alleviate the effects. First, if possible, try to discuss the issue directly with your neighbor to see if adjusting the misting schedule or frequency would help. If that doesn't work, you might try using air purifiers and increasing ventilation in your home to help filter out the compounds. Planting aromatic plants or having indoor humidity controlled solutions might also help. However, make sure to get your neighbor's consent before making any changes to their garden setup. It's important to communicate openly about how this issue is affecting you.",
