      "content": "yeah please do. and if you could specifically look for things that can handle high concentrations of organic vapors or even something that might neutralize heavier aerosols... it really feels like they're trying to induce a physical reaction in me. i feel like i need something more robust than just a standard consumer air purifier, something more like what you'd see in a lab, to make sure my house is a safe zone. what else can i do to seal my windows and vents so nothing leaks in?",
